# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / backend
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Model weights, downloaded on first run and cached.
pretrained_models/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / frontend
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime data — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Enrolled voiceprints are biometric data. Meeting records and uploaded
# recordings are user content. Neither belongs in version control.
backend/storage/*
!backend/storage/.gitkeep

# Master copies of evaluation recordings. Deliberately OUTSIDE
# backend/storage/, which the UI's delete button empties — the sample WAV behind
# the documented ASR baseline was lost exactly that way. Large media, still not
# committed.
test_audios/

logs/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Design source material — nothing originating from Google Stitch is committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The zip, the extracted HTML/PNG export, the merged token JSON and the
# generator script all stay local.
#
# Consequence: frontend/src/styles/tokens.css is the *output* of
# design/tokens/gen_tokens.py, so with the generator excluded that CSS is
# ordinary committed source and must be edited by hand. It is deliberately
# NOT ignored — without it the frontend has no colours and will not build.
design/
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working documents
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch and superseded planning docs — kept on disk, out of the repo.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored:
#   README.md   how to run and tune the system
#   CLAUDE.md   project memory. Encodes measured ASR results and design
#               provenance that cost real time to establish; ignoring it means
#               a fresh clone loses all of it.
STITCH_PROMPT.md
DESIGN.md
IMPLEMENTATION_BRIEF.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
scratch/
tmp/
CLAUDE.md
DESIGN.md
HANDOFF.md